  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The default F5 key to toggle Third-Person View also causes several video players to refresh/reload a video, including at [Popcorn Palace](https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_266523e8-9161-40da-acd0-6bd82e075833/info).\n\nI usually have Untrusted URLs disabled. Sometimes I may have untrusted URLs enabled temporarily for one video only, and pressing F5 to toggle Third-Person View may cause that video to unintentionally refresh and display a video error due to untrusted URLs only.\n\nI have no suggestion what the new hotkey should be, but it should not be F5 (refresh) or F11 (full-screen).\n\nSimilar to: https://feedback.vrchat.com/third-person-view/p/default-keys-keybinds-feedback-pc",
